+Now that�s a straight lie.
+Coinkite�s latest post claims they performed AI-assisted code reviews weeks before the vulnerability was discovered. Yet people have shown that Claude can identify the bug in just a 8 minutes.
+Yes, it depends on the prompt too, but I�d expect the entropy generation logic to be one of the first areas reviewed. Instead of prompts like �Find a security issue in this code� or �find a bug in this code� will never expose the issue.
